[`std::thread_local`]: ../../std/macro.thread_local.html
[`std::thread::current`]: ../../std/thread/fn.current.html
[`std::thread::park`]: ../../std/thread/fn.park.html
[`std::thread::Thread`]: ../../std/thread/struct.Thread.html
