## Initializing a struct field-by-field

You can use `MaybeUninit<T>` and the [`&raw mut`] syntax to initialize structs field by field:

```rust
use std::mem::MaybeUninit;

#[derive(Debug, PartialEq)]
pub struct Foo {
    name: String,
    list: Vec<u8>,
}

